zcode-open-bridge-go
====================

This project is a Go port of tizerluo/zcode-open-bridge
(https://github.com/tizerluo/zcode-open-bridge), MIT licensed.

Porting baseline: upstream commit 3069013 (see upstream.lock), plus the
AskUserQuestion feature from the local clone's commits (f256268 and the
uncommitted changes archived in docs/upstream/local-baseline.patch) which
have not been upstreamed.

Protocol facts recorded in docs/zcode-protocol.md were obtained by
reverse-engineering the ZCode CLI app-server protocol; ZCode itself is not
part of, nor bundled with, this project.
